      "end": 5,
      "text": " ILP brings you prepared clients and handles the follow-up after each call."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 5,
      "end": 12,
      "text": " Members arrive with their question written down, and our team does the booking and chasing you would otherwise do unpaid."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 12,
      "end": 19,
      "text": " You set your hours and read a one-screen brief before each call. Afterwards you confirm the summary, and we take it from there."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 19,
      "end": 26,
      "text": " Joining is free and you keep your own practice. Work beyond a call is quoted by you and accepted by the member."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 26,
      "end": 31,
      "text": " The application has seven short steps, and you can save a draft and finish it later."
    }
  ],
